---
description: Keep COMMANDS.md updated after every test
globs: ["**/*.ts", "**/*.tsx"]
alwaysApply: true
---

After every tool is tested or fixed, update COMMANDS.md:
- Move confirmed working tools to ✅ section
- Move broken tools to ❌ section with error + fix
- Remove from ⏳ once tested either way
- Update "Last updated" date on every change
- Never delete rows — only move them between sections
